{"545820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wanderland", "steam_appid": 545820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [618980, 607840, 700670, 700700, 700710, 700690, 700680, 819100, 819101, 819102, 819103, 819104, 819105], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Steam group!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Steam group to learn more about our games, events and giveaways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/9320f311e7533d0c91f81884457821cd.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Magical Hidden Object Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magical world where fairy tales come to life, and dark secrets lie hidden around every corner. Sleeping Beauty has disappeared, and only you can uncover the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through enchanted forests, forgotten temples, mysterious crypts, and magical kingdoms as you solve hidden object puzzles, complete quests, and meet unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/82e50f591fc7c6f18c47527fbf21b66d.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=322 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Living Fairy-Tale World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dozens of beautifully illustrated locations filled with hidden treasures, magical creatures, and exciting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new area offers fresh mysteries, story-driven quests, and unique challenges as you journey deeper into Wanderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/5e431c10bab0679336f1e18d96627280.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/46e1614c917504e4954968d6a4ad921b.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search, Discover and Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Object scenes are at the heart of your adventure. Search detailed environments for cleverly hidden items, uncover valuable rewards, and solve mysteries that move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, collect treasures, and unlock new locations as you continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/f3ae5c55bd7da5711bcf9c2d04343b6f.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=226 /></span><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545820/extras/74eb414c2c45bf84a6f03db62622883b.avif?t=1786541473\" width=600 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Memorable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure is filled with heroes, mysterious allies, magical creatures, and dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept quests, uncover secrets, battle powerful foes, and discover the stories that shape the world of Wanderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><spa